{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "The Goodbye Dinner"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Thanks Anyway"}, {"type": "position", "content": 2}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 8}, {"type": "level", "content": "A1.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use information, involving apologies, thanks, suggestions and invitations in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Making Dinner Reservations"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you make a dinner reservation, you use formal words and expressions. You can use verbs with infinitives such as <span class=\"italic\">like to</span> or <span class=\"italic\">want to</span>.<br>When you answer people's requests, it is important to reply in a polite way."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Making a Reservation\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Responding to Requests\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I would like to book a table.<br />I would like to make a reservation.<br>Do you have room for 5 people tomorrow?<br>Could we book a table for Sunday?</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Certainly, Sir/Madam.<br>For how many people?<br>Absolutely. Would you like to make a reservation?<br>I'm very sorry, we are closed on Sundays.</span> \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: I would like to book a table for tomorrow. <br><span class=\"strong\">Waiter</span>: Certainly. For how many people? <br> <span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: Four people, please. <br> <span class=\"strong\">Waiter</span>: Very well. May I have your name for the reservation, please?  "}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "closed "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "not open"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The restaurant is closed on Sundays."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob02aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you make a dinner reservation."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "booked"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "full; reserved"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Sorry, we are completely booked for dinner tomorrow."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob02aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to apologize"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to say sorry"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I apologize for the inconvenience."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob02aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "in case"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "if; in the event of"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You could make a reservation in case someone cancels."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob02aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "cancellation"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "when someone doesn't want a reservation anymore"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We have a cancellation. Would you like to book a table?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob02aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "I'm afraid"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "I'm sorry; unfortunately "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The restaurant is completely booked, I'm afraid."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob02aud06"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn3le08ob02re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Call a restaurant to make a reservation."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Respond to the reservation."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Make and respond to the requests in a polite way."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Practice saying your dialogue aloud with your partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Exchange roles with your partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I make reservations."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about food."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I make and respond to requests."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn3le08ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn3le08ob02re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn3le08ob02re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miguel</span>: El Taco Loco, this is Miguel speaking. How may I help you? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Good evening. I would like to book a table for tomorrow evening.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miguel</span>: For how many people?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Four, please.<br>", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn3le08ob02re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miguel</span>: Just a moment. Hmm ... I'm very sorry, but we are completely booked for dinner tomorrow.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Ok ... how about Sunday?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miguel</span>: We are closed on Sundays, I'm afraid.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You're closed?! This is very bad! Sunday is our last chance to celebrate with my friend.<br>", "id": 2, "time": "11500", "image": "engenn3le08ob02re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miguel</span>: Well,  I could put your name on the waiting list. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Why would I do that?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miguel</span>: In case there is a cancellation, I could call you back.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Thanks, but I would like to make sure we have a table.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miguel</span>: I understand. We apologize for the inconvenience.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: That's fine. Thanks anyway.<br>", "id": 3, "time": "33000", "image": "engenn3le08ob02re2img01.jpg"}]}}]}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can talk about social occasions."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can make a dinner reservation."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can make and respond to requests."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "Where do you want to take your friends for a special occasion?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "Where would you like your friends to take you?"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}]}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": "Ask your partner:"}, {"type": "free_type_text_area", "c